  <item>
    <title>逛街偶遇Dino，具体只能在节目里细讲；Hoshi的小狗像一颗牛肉丸！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/686a64fc93fd2d72b8c991d3</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">686a64fc93fd2d72b8c991d3</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 06 Jul 2025 12:22:54 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>在韩2天，上演跌宕破格的三幕剧，打眼一看简直像梦话：</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><strong><span>试衣间门口走来一位可爱壮汉，仔细一看是李灿；</span></strong></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span>在Hoshi妈妈与姐姐面前大搞乌龙，差点成为全韩最愚蠢的中女；</span></strong></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span>回到住所遭遇灵异事件，汝矣岛刑警也没破案的诡异一幕。</span></strong></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="130">02:10</a> super P人在svt造型室，没预约也剪到了最满意的发型，回头发现主动为我打折的发型师，就是S.COUPS的担当老师。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="350">05:50</a> 逛街偶遇Dino，我们是一起分享试衣间的关系；经典的偶遇爱豆文学会说：</span><br><span>“擦肩而过的瞬间，心跳比我先认出你”，那我的版本就是：</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>“擦肩而过的瞬间，两个爱买老头衫的灵魂突然共振”。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1910">31:50</a> 老崔哥的餐馆真好吃，淳朴真男人意外有sense的样子很动人！</span></p><span></span><p><em><span>（好吃到追不上对焦）</span></em></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkXmtN52RSSnoHY-jbc2OSkBl0fd.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2453">40:53</a> Hoshi的小狗像一颗高弹潮汕牛肉丸，这是世界上最臭蛋也最好看的奇怪小狗，而我，是世界上最愚蠢的外国女人。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpRinOzBGiCn2u76gWLy9flVC71i.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3382">56:22</a> 首尔民宿灵异事件：半夜回住所，怀疑房间里可能藏了人。</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/62825b1a144faaf5be6b74b5/luvGPpqBoutinsyEs0ZvaiRQo3Wt.m4a" length="70733827" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:11:49</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrA9xLIy1_zBU6Js0NAcOr0Awuka.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
