    <title>01.《NANA Tour》拍砸了？从起床游戏就注定：10年罗粉聊聊罗英石这次为什么不灵了</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65d13dec513a776b575d45ec</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">65d13dec513a776b575d45ec</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 17 Feb 2024 23:14:51 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>对不起！为标题道歉！</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>怀着万分虔诚的饭心，讲点NANA Tour的小遗憾，除了这30min其他都是大好特好！</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>这半年会开特辑，邀请各种厉害次友，夸夸每一位svt成员！</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>而第1期，主要讨伐罗英石！！（吓人。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="8">00:08</a> 3点重要信息提前说明！很重要！</span></p><span></span><p><span>（以下标题都以耸人听闻为主，别忘心里去）</span></p><span></span><blockquote><em><strong><span>1.定位模糊，可能是NANA Tour最大的遗憾。</span></strong></em></blockquote><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="120">02:00</a> 从《两天一夜》宝库中，幻化出了罗氏出品的所有爆款模板，但是我们英石哥，这次非要点隐藏菜单。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="260">04:20</a> “起床游戏”是NANA Tour从爆款预备役滑向失败的拐点吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span>综艺责任感太强的SVT成员们总不能是好心办坏事！</span></p><span></span><p><span>虽然不知道全圆佑到底是“殷志源”还是“李泳志”，</span></p><span></span><p><span>但我肯定，“李秀根”和“安宥真”很难产生化学反应。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="462">07:42</a> 但这场起床游戏，仍是我看过最高水准的综艺剪辑！赞美所有人</span></strong><strong><span>！！</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="635">10:35</a> SVT成功之核心=真不能再镜头前吵架 ，但没有冲突与发展的故事，很难持续吸引人。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="695">11:35</a> 个人恶趣味：看尹净汉被欺凌。&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>⚠️下集预告，热烈探讨SVT相关所有微妙恶趣味嘿嘿⚠️</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="735">12:15</a> 金珉奎&amp;尹净汉：可以吵架，但不想。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="769">12:49</a> 不论我多爱酷普斯，一想到这件事，还是想朝他屁股踢两脚！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="991">16:31</a> 金珉奎：童话般梦幻的“完美受害者”。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjPgVHP3Wu-X4xxZ-2KQwBehEfrw.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1053">17:33</a> 夫胜宽：刚好差半口气的综艺天才。&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjhDAF4VgDIbvrEtg3PdyJsPNKdD.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1103">18:23</a> 尹净汉：抓住罗英石的手，也只能遗憾放开。放开了的不只是英石哥的手，还有终于错失了的“大众性”。</span></p><span></span><blockquote><em><strong><span>2.大家真的，好累。</span></strong></em></blockquote><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1347">22:27</a> &nbsp;NANA Tour：最大的遗憾竟是全员体力不支。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1391">23:11</a> 精致的螺蛳壳道场式制作本是SVT的法宝：</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgybCpUBZDP8jaQ88_66GdNIcWDs.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjMAbI3YSKNzc42jYUd0g-aKTJny.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhaRo6GNxYa7esRAFj7X3n1-mtEK.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fnh7miPimGxDFrhfXm6WYMGPFkUh.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1517">25:17</a> 《花样青春》有专门的航拍组蹲点拍摄大草原日出日落小猎豹子学步，而NANA Tour的空镜，拍得有点丑。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1666">27:46</a> 这一趟晕船晕车的欧洲小镇之旅究竟是否值得，NANA Tour踩点组或为失败最大原因。&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1793">29:53</a> 如果一切都只是因为太爱了，那这能是爱的错吗？</span></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span>始终差一口气，就是独属于SVT自己的浪漫吧。</span></strong></em></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fqr3hvTz6ewoTrjfAxkQtc_lVmbT.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p>]]></description>
